---
title: UptimeCore Native Tests
description: Host-side tests for hardware-independent Uptime LilyGo behavior
ms.date: 2026-09-18
ms.topic: reference
---

## Scope

The native test suite covers logic provided by `lib/UptimeCore`, without
requiring an ESP32-S3 board:

* HTTP status classification
* Site status counting and transitions
* Display brightness conversion
* Refresh interval boundaries and `millis()` rollover

## Run Tests

Run the suite from the repository root:

```bash
$HOME/.platformio/penv/bin/platformio test -e native
```

See the [PlatformIO unit testing documentation](https://docs.platformio.org/en/latest/advanced/unit-testing/index.html)
for test runner details.
